  eventID: SofaDuoInitial
  dialogueLines:
  - "These guys seem pretty wrapped up in their conversation. I wonder if they\u2019re
    sentient"
  - "Huh, these guys look surprisingly invested in whatever they\u2019re talking
    about. I wonder if they\u2019re actually sentient"
  - "They seem pretty deep in conversation. Makes you wonder if there\u2019s anything
    going on in those heads"
  - "These two look like they\u2019re having a very serious chat. I wonder if they\u2019re
    sentient or just really good at pretending"
  - "They seem completely absorbed in their conversation. I\u2019m starting to wonder
    if they\u2019re actually alive in there"
